pythonSynopsis: list matrix=sim.buildMatrixQ(list position,list quaternion)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. position: table of 3 values
2. quaternion: table of 4 values
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. matrix: table containing the transformation matrix
